{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 Wishlist now to follow development and get notified at launch!<br>\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Join our Discord and be a part of the playtest!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/bf799fea671eec8f63438c63c22a7224.avif?t=1771586302\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/852515517fb445588d0e65206d15f9e1.poster.avif?t=1771586302\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/852515517fb445588d0e65206d15f9e1.webm?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/852515517fb445588d0e65206d15f9e1.mp4?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roy can<strong> hijack enemy robots</strong> in the middle of battle. Run low on health? Jump to another body. Outnumbered? Steal a stronger frame. Every fight becomes a puzzle of survival and opportunity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/a666cf9c8c8650bb831703fdb4c66a8b.avif?t=1771586302\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7c8f96f3b468133475549185d12db2dd.poster.avif?t=1771586302\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7c8f96f3b468133475549185d12db2dd.webm?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7c8f96f3b468133475549185d12db2dd.mp4?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Sullivan Corporation knows you\u2019ve escaped. Their response? <strong>Unleashing waves of deadly machines</strong> to stop you. Fast reflexes and smart thinking are your only hope.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-based combat that gets harder with each round</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face robots with unique AI, weapons, and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic FPS chaos \u2014 shoot, strafe, slide, and dominate</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/2c1d6bea014001d54fb9a304334bc90a.avif?t=1771586302\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7956427e6d8a9889bcc6f58a75564ef1.poster.avif?t=1771586302\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7956427e6d8a9889bcc6f58a75564ef1.webm?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/7956427e6d8a9889bcc6f58a75564ef1.mp4?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each robot you hijack completely changes how you fight \u2014 from agile run-and-gun Rangers to slow, brutal Tanks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Ranger</strong> \u2013 Assault rifle, deployable shield, and grenade launcher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tank</strong> \u2013 Minigun, gravitational pull, and a bullet-reflecting matrix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trickster, Breacher, and more</strong> \u2013 Each with signature abilities, weapons, and playstyles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/0f955b7442e18695cb6912c87b971cf7.avif?t=1771586302\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/ddf6640976795e6d867009f98a3f73da.poster.avif?t=1771586302\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/ddf6640976795e6d867009f98a3f73da.webm?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/ddf6640976795e6d867009f98a3f73da.mp4?t=1771586302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every possession, every kill \u2014 makes you stronger. Customize each run with randomized upgrade cards, and evolve Roy\u2019s AI between battles.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Temporary Upgrades \u2013 Power-up on the fly with combat abilities and modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Roy Level Progression \u2013 Earn XP across runs to level up and push deeper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Customize Your Build \u2013 Stack upgrades to suit your playstyle: brute force, control, or speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/extras/f563294fe9efe09dc9d008d6c88a9b3c.avif?t=1771586302\" width=613 height=142 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sullivan Facility is a living labyrinth of high-tech experimentation and ruthless control. Can you make it out?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Labs</strong> \u2013 Clinical, neon-lit testing chambers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Sectors</strong> \u2013 Steam-filled arenas and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Corporate HQ</strong> \u2013 The final gauntlet\u2026 and your ultimate adversary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3480960?t=1771586302","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771586302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/ea24b1c30fdb155dbb43611851222df323adc547/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771586302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480960/ea24b1c30fdb155dbb43611851222df323adc547/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771586302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3851310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 Wishlist now to follow development and get notified at launch!<br>\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 <strong>Join our Discord and be a part of the playtest!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><s